      210   field max-records   as integer
      211   field min-plu       as integer
      212   field max-plu       as integer
      213   field num-fields    as integer
      214   field task-num      as character
      215   field by-record     as logical
      216   field send-get      as character
      217   field cash-num      as integer
      218   field cash-num-char as character
      219   field port-num      as character
      220   field way           as character
      221   field is-script     as logical
      222   field pswd          as character
      223   field waiting-sek   as integer
      224   field other-info    as character
      225   field order-num     as integer
      226   field secondary     as integer
      227   field shift-fields  as integer
      228   field binary        as logical
      229   field range         as integer
      230   index pi is unique primary
      231   filename
      232   range
